# Theme and views

When editing Views, Components, or `Theme.swift`, also load the `ios-design` skill. Design tokens and copy are locked in `docs/PLAN.md` Part 2 — do not invent a new palette or type system.

## Tokens only
- Every color, font, spacing, and radius comes from `Theme`. No hex literals or raw font sizes in Views/Components.
- Paper lilac background, deep plum ink, one violet accent. No dark mode.
- Fonts: Bricolage Grotesque (display), Instrument Serif Italic (accent/notes), Geist Mono (places/times, ALL CAPS), SF Pro (UI).

## Components
Reuse `Badge`, `Stamp`, `PrimaryButton`/`SecondaryButton`, `SocialButton`, `TapButton`. Do not reimplement them inline.

## Motion
Springs (response 0.45, damping 0.7). Respect Reduce Motion. Scan-result drop + stamp haptic is the signature moment.

## Copy
Short and warm. First names. Match the Part 2 phrase table ("You met Maya", "Not on the app yet", etc.).
